================================================================================
Third-party AI models and their licenses
================================================================================

Sauti bundles pre-quantised AI models. Each model retains its own license, recorded
per-entry in ai-models/<stage>/manifest.json. Summary:

* Whisper Small + Whisper Tiny INT8 ONNX exports
    Original by OpenAI; ONNX conversion by onnx-community.
    License: MIT.
    Source: https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/whisper-small
            https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/whisper-tiny

* Qwen3-1.7B-Q5_K_M GGUF
    Original by Alibaba (Qwen team); GGUF quantisation by unsloth.
    License: Apache 2.0.
    Source: https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-1.7B-GGUF

* all-MiniLM-L6-v2 INT8 ONNX + WordPiece vocab.txt
    Original by sentence-transformers; INT8 export by Xenova.
    License: Apache 2.0.
    Source: https://huggingface.co/Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

* Kokoro 82M INT8 ONNX + 11 voice .bin files + tokenizer.json
    ONNX export by onnx-community.
    License: Apache 2.0.
    Source: https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-ONNX

* Gemma3-1B Q4_K_M GGUF [DEFERRED — not shipped in v1.2]
    Original by Google; GGUF quantisation by google.
    License: Gemma Terms of Use (NOT a standard SPDX licence).
    Source: https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-3-1b-it-GGUF
    Status: Manifest entry retained at ai-models/llm/manifest.json with
    status: deferred. Future releases may re-activate after explicit
    acceptance of Gemma's terms.

